Error: Jet.DottedPathPrefixUnresolved: `nowhere.square` starts with no module of this program.
 Why: A dotted path splits at its longest prefix that names one module of the program, and the rest names a declaration in that module.
 Fix: Start the path with the dotted name of exactly one module of the program: `dotted_path_unknown_prefix`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DottedPathPrefixUnresolved
